    "text": "By Jay Hart ,\n14 hours ago CHARLOTTESVILLE, VA (CVILLE RIGHT NOW) – Transportation projects and educational needs highlight the agenda for Wednesday’s Albemarle County Board of Supervisors meeting. Over the past four months, County staff has been working to update the Albemarle County Transportation Project List and revisit the prioritization methodology, according to the agenda briefing. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
